% c094 (Rimsky-Korsakov PDF 51: in forte one trombone = two horns, a string section = two woodwinds; PDF 90 rule 1 exception: a part to be made prominent): 110 and 112 Tbn 1-2 release under the scale figure (Vc at 110, Vla at 112, now with Bn 1 at the unison, PDF 52), which lay in the trombones' C4-G3 register; horns, trumpets, tuba keep the V7.
